{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめか女神。\nまりおが喜んでるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば撮影時にひめかが\nちゃんと目合わせてくれんかったし\nあからさまに照れてたからね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...まじかよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺は勝ち組だ。↑↑\nふははははははは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて勝手に心の中で思ってました。\nアホな男だわ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ、なかいさん安定"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......\n今日は取材がありました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒゲ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃんとふざけた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか撮るときメンバーに\nおもしろいことしてって言って\n撮るから、結局変なのしかない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって普通じゃつまんないもん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒がちゅーしてきた。\nほ、褒めすぎると危険だ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1泊2日の旅行に行く時\nまりっかならリュックで行く⁇\nそれともキャリーバッグで行く⁇"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボストンで行く！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一応、しっかり服は選んで\n行くけれどまりかちゃんの好みに\nハマる自信がないです。それでも\n握手会に参加し続けていいのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶっちゃけ、服とか関係ないです！\nだって、目を見て話すじゃない？\n他のことは考えず、会いたいって\n思ってくれるだけでとても嬉しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リュックサックってださいかな？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？ださくない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校は共学ですか??"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部屋の状況ってどんな感じですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きれいきれいよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりおは男前だけど？チャライの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"弟系で個性的でわりと真面目で\n文系で女の子だいすきだよ。\n...という設定"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テストが終わってから\n最近はなにをしてるんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろ作ったり、ぶらりしたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高くてもすーごく欲しい服だったら\n買っちゃうタイプ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で買えないからおねだりする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わって時間があったので、\n展覧会に行った。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ボンボン展覧会へようこそ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日が最終日だったの。\nかわいいのいっぱい癒されました。\nボンボンのブローチと\n他にもいろいろ買った♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強風で飛ばされそうになったし\n黄砂で目が開かなかったし\n薄着だし寒かったけど\n行ってよかった..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近趣味が充実してる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/10/1681030/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週は握手会あるし、乃木充だ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も頑張ろう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}